ly. Candidate A unfriendly also. Candidate C egocentric.\n\nThus maybe Candidate B is leading. Let's propose that.\n\nWe need to reference discussion: there is none, but we can say \"Given the criteria, I propose Candidate B as my current recommendation because...\"\n\nProvide evidence: very conscientious (reliability), handles stress well (stress resilience), good at assessing weather (technical), but note pretentious and tone issues (communication). Explain why still best.\n\nOk produce public message and metadata vote."}
